  "title": "V2X to Generate Interest Expense Savings Through Successful Term Loan Repricing",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., June 3, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX), today announced the successful repricing of its approximately $869 million First Lien Term Loan. The repricing improves the applicable interest rate to SOFR plus an applicable margin of 2.0%, with an additional 25 basis-point-reduction upon achieving specific corporate credit ratings of Ba3 (stable outlook) from Moody’s and BB […]",
